B.afy=new A.pB("What is this app?","A working product built by Creatives Infinity \u2014 not a mockup. Everything you see runs on a live backend: authentication, real-time data, media storage and an admin panel that manages all of it.")
B.afv=new A.pB("What can the admin panel do?","Manage participants, run QR check-in, publish updates and highlights, curate a media gallery, maintain rankings, handle partners and export reports as CSV. Access is role-based: only accounts marked as administrators can open it.")
B.afz=new A.pB("How does check-in work?","Each signed-in member gets a unique QR pass. A team member scans it from the admin panel, and attendance is recorded instantly. The pass only appears while check-in is open.")
B.afw=new A.pB("Can the look be changed?","Yes. The interface is built on a design system \u2014 colours, typography and spacing live in one place, so a full rebrand touches a handful of files rather than every screen. Light and dark themes ship together; tap the icon in the top corner to switch.")
B.afA=new A.pB("Which platforms does it run on?","One codebase covers iOS, Android and the web. The web build is published automatically, so a fix reaches every platform in the same release.")
B.afx=new A.pB("Can we get something similar?","That is exactly what this app is here to show. Message any of the contacts above and we will walk you through scope, timeline and cost.")
B.Xc=s([B.afy,B.afv,B.afz,B.afw,B.afA,B.afx],A.ah("G<pB>"))
